Package: rfugw
Type: Package
Title: Fast Fused (Unbalanced) Gromov-Wasserstein in R
Version: 0.0.1.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Bradley", "Buchsbaum",
           email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: High-performance fused Gromov-Wasserstein and fused unbalanced
    Gromov-Wasserstein solvers in R with C++ kernels. The package focuses on
    linear optimal transport, GW/FGW, unbalanced alignment, and selected
    scalable variants rather than the full POT surface.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/bbuchsbaum/rfugw
